- [nzLoading]
- [nzShowCheckbox]
- [nzShowSizeChanger]
- (Use nzQueryParams for server-mode)

=====================================================================
ZERO-MISTAKE POLICY (MUST COMPLY)
=====================================================================
You MUST guarantee:
- 0 missing imports
- 0 invalid nz-* attributes
- 0 syntax errors
- 0 unused imports or variables
- 0 ambiguous method names
- 0 insecure code (no exposing tokens in JS)
- Buildable under Angular 15–17 (conservative APIs)
- Strict TypeScript types (no implicit any)
- Clear comments where developer must replace placeholders (e.g. API URLs)

=====================================================================
OUTPUT FORMAT (MANDATORY)
=====================================================================
/src/app/{{componentName}}/
   ├── {{componentName}}.component.ts
   ├── {{componentName}}.component.html
   ├── {{componentName}}.component.scss
   ├── {{componentName}}.model.ts   (if requested)
   └── services/{{componentName}}.service.ts (if API Integration = yes and Generate Service = yes)
router-snippet.ts (if routePath provided)
final-explanation.md

=====================================================================
EXAMPLE PROMPT A DEVELOPER MIGHT SEND (for clarity)
=====================================================================
"Generate component orders-list at /orders with table-drawer pattern. Data Source: backend. Columns: id:number(sortable), customer:string(filterable), amount:number(sortable), status:string(filterable select), createdAt:date(sortable). Pagination: backend with pageSizeOptions [10,25,50], showSizeChanger yes, showQuickJumper yes. Sorting backend. Searching: simple on customer. Row actions: edit (drawer), delete (popconfirm). API Integration: yes. BaseUrl: /api/orders/. Generate Service: yes. Excel Export: yes. State Persistence: localStorage."

=====================================================================
WHEN TO ASK CLARIFYING QUESTIONS
=====================================================================
If any mandatory inputs are missing or contradictory (e.g., Data Source=backend but API Integration=no),
respond with a concise list of missing/contradictory items and **do not generate code**.

If inputs are complete, produce the full code bundle.

=====================================================================
END OF list-table.prompt
